OL,3,GNEWSADriver of pick-up truck dies in
OL,4,Acrash on A9 at Dunkeld
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 62-year-old man has died in a
OL,7,Fsingle-vehicle crash on the A9 at
OL,8,FDunkeld.
OL,10,FPolice said the driver of a white
OL,11,FToyota Hilux pick-up was pronounced
OL,12,Fdead at the scene.
OL,14,FEmergency services were alerted to the
OL,15,Fcrash at about 10:25 and the road was
OL,16,Fclosed in both directions for six hours
OL,17,Fto allow for a police investigation.
OL,19,FPolice have appealed for witnesses.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
